		{"id":"66ed7f0cfbd65823","type":"text","text":"# Rendering Equation\n\n## back-to-front composition\n$$C_{dst} = \\alpha_{src}C_{src} + (1-\\alpha_{src})C_{dst}$$\n## front-to-back composition\n$$C_{dst} = \\alpha_{dst}\\alpha_{src}C_{src}+C_{dst}, \\quad \\alpha_{dst} = (1-\\alpha_{src})\\alpha_{dst}$$\n\n$C_{dst}$ = Accmulated color\n$C_{src}$ = Color provided by[[ transfer function]]\n$\\alpha_{dst}$ = Accumulated opacity\n$\\alpha_{src}$ = Opasity provided by [[transfer function]]\n\n#TODO: diese formeln benutzen","x":648,"y":4401,"width":478,"height":440},
